{"id":"6e4e3fc5e4e9e2ce","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-milross.md","title":"Null-Ideal Cardinal-Invariant Bounds","display":"thm-milross — Null-Ideal Cardinal-Invariant Bounds","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-milross","aliases":["58-thm-milross"],"display":"thm-milross — Null-Ideal Cardinal-Invariant Bounds","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-null-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-milross"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-milross</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-milross — Null-Ideal Cardinal-Invariant Bounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13a5b3e71c6d5d19\" href=\"?note=13a5b3e71c6d5d19\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9dcb3365c965859\" href=\"?note=f9dcb3365c965859\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number\">58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"837919a2170e3c1d\" href=\"?note=837919a2170e3c1d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-null-number.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-null-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> (the null ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,c,d\">\\(a,c,d\\)</span> (cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(a,\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(a,\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (the assertion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\operatorname{add}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(a=\\operatorname{add}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(c,\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(c,\\mathcal N)\\)</span> (the assertion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\operatorname{cov}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(c=\\operatorname{cov}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityNullNumber}_S(d,\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityNullNumber}_S(d,\\mathcal N)\\)</span> (the assertion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\operatorname{cof}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(d=\\operatorname{cof}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}milross}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(a,\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(c,\\mathcal N)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityNullNumber}_S(d,\\mathcal N)\n\\right)\n\\to a\\leq c\\leq d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}milross}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(a,\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(c,\\mathcal N)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityNullNumber}_S(d,\\mathcal N)\n\\right)\n\\to a\\leq c\\leq d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These inequalities follow from the definitions: fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{add}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\operatorname{add}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span> null sets cannot cover <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>, and a cofinal family in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> yields a null cover by taking its union.</li>\n<li>The legacy label is retained for link stability; no standard “Milross theorem” supports the former claim about <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa\">\\(2^\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"13a5b3e71c6d5d19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ci-additivity-null-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number","status":"resolved","id":"f9dcb3365c965859","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-null-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"837919a2170e3c1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-null-number.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"a,c,d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(a,\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\operatorname{add}(\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(c,\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"c=\\operatorname{cov}(\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityNullNumber}_S(d,\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"d=\\operatorname{cof}(\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}milross}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAdditivityNullNumber}_S(a,\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiC